{"candidateAnswer":"Seraphim","evidence":"[D2:24 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Jolene: I bought it a year ago in Paris.\n[D2:28 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Jolene: Even as a child I learned to play on my own.\n[D16:6 | 9:26 am on 1 August, 2023] Jolene: I adopted her two years ago when I was feeling lonely and wanted some company.","itemId":"urn:uuid:d45ccd45-8b06-57e4-9aaf-da9e55945af0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:23f7233d1860742ace1522690acd4f9814de6d5355a38a5708e8746716e1755d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which pet did Jolene adopt first - Susie or Seraphim?","referenceAnswer":"Susie","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"23f7233d1860742ace1522690acd4f9814de6d5355a38a5708e8746716e1755d"}}]}